  "ruleText": "Env-A 1003.02 Applicability. This part shall apply to any sponsoring fire service organization conducting open burning within the state for firefighter instruction and training.\n\nSource. #7850, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9863, INTERIM, eff 3-4-11, EXPIRES: 8-31-11; ss by #9909, eff 5-1-11; ss by #12831, eff 8-1-19",
